;Description
:This template is used to link to an Weibo account.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Weibo|<username>}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Weibo Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Weibo|6856340946|mafumafu weibo description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Weibo|6856340946|mafumafu weibo description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

